{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1537,
  "batch_count": 14486,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d132b23d4930aa230afc3fa",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "早晨醒来后，首先要做\n舒缓的拉伸。身体循环调整好后，\n连心都会变得轻盈起来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "314d7086ca09462ec5888b473da097efb71da73bfe157655f49803a0bf0a24c7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "90000"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1143/90000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4c931824edb7f707389429c",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "上学途中，有一对麻雀夫妇\n从树枝上向我搭话。它们说，今天的\n风很舒服呢…呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "041aa33076f62ee46ff4759b0d2efffa46f4336ba39e489ca738b5be1f2a94cf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "90001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1143/90001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbf71803f7e2f5f20f735122",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在食堂里，我和坐在旁边座位的\n孩子聊了起来…那是一段愉快到\n差点忘了吃饭的时光。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5cc909e613804dd4612cf8fc85ba301544650fee40784ecfa3165bfa7f99a26",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "90002"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1143/90002"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de5a329985cbf8a63d141418",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我在想要不要邀请玫瑰同学\n去吃烤肉卷摊。味道稍微浓郁些，\n但我想她会觉得很新鲜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a058cf992d7e9b93c90813869ff5779fdeb6a8e712c53e1153e5c6cb5ede8118",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "90003"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1143/90003"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80802bc404ab8ea78ae9469e",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看到大家解出难题时的\n笑容，我就很开心。\n今天也要一起开学习会。",
      "source_fingerprint": "85fc332995cb96fc6725e3377503c729a78d3c001b0f55283c45b3bd8d63bfec",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "90004"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1143/90004"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b03624c40eaf3299160e45f",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "睡前，我会翻开最喜欢的画集。\n看着美丽的画作，心也仿佛\n静静地安宁下来…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8af1b8cca320b6e3676d60e805203549caf278f099a61c4698a20bd0a6bac2f1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "90005"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1143/90005"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8faf10de60ca964a21c39ad",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "很多孩子会对新环境感到困惑…\n所以我会主动和她们说话，聊聊花。\n希望她们能稍微抬起头向前走。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1413332c5d99bd15fa0b6576a7818f39d95b2a82176a4c8be14d4c5e61fbcb8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "90006"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1143/90006"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66244f11a914890f09e4ba90",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "蛇形烟花，真是不可思议呢…。\n黑色的弯曲痕迹像要形成圆环，\n却又没有形成…莫名让人印象深刻…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "feb0c779213bd132661c01daa4dfae1c53136857429b456d97da9df46d26217e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "90007"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1143/90007"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08a6f25b96616f918510ec20",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "前阵子，万籁争鸣同学\n邀请我去听音乐会…呵呵。好像是\n为了感谢我介绍推荐的画展。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d278a3515d3bb4407ac4cae87aff23917d938a2f22ea7107f2b7c0ffa4972c72",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "90008"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1143/90008"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea2cfc3756d9908da1732ed0",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "冬天时，我们一家人常常围着\n壁炉的火。被同一团火焰温暖着，\n感觉心也会变得温暖…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d513b58103795fa414ddb0df5c7380b06e662d685daf55cc8310864f8faef3a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "90009"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1143/90009"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7073ce637bb7c12d1166679b",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "84545e9d062a703e60cf0240a4c6690b3f86c69931c0b8d072086c92aed0b29d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "90020"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1143/90020"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a805bc79bcec1e4b237a263b",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "万籁争鸣同学的音乐，总是让我的心\n雀跃不已。昨晚我们也一边护理尾巴，\n一边一起哼着歌。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e56dd1a47c9542c8755b0391260e5a25f1116b00c0fc9384e597e4a05cd5268d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "91000"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1143/91000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31fd41dd1f23fbf2a679efce",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看到没有插上的插头，\n我总会忍不住在意。\n总觉得它看起来有些寂寞…",
      "source_fingerprint": "860e2b3d3c22b293770373f404a8318de2f80dd7d2a71d1f96a4ced89ad67e0e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "91001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1143/91001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82efb5ac05e886c71d2a8602",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我经常和在法国留学的朋友\n视频通话。每次都聊得很开心，\n让人感觉不到距离呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "21bcc23049ef2daa9fc67ad48178f5d3cbe96f61a178ad028fc7954cc401b4d1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "91002"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1143/91002"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6073aba693c9b835849ed1fc",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在宝石之中，绿松石尤其会\n夺走我的心。那鲜明的水蓝色，\n总会让我不由得看入迷…",
      "source_fingerprint": "5964a51af13f077e4a06dc1b7f55a608987f436dfad3db30ecb5f424dffc6bcd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "91003"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1143/91003"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35cd72713c2cc53db357e5cc",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "袜子我总是会先用夹子夹住\n再收起来。要是只剩下一只，\n就太可怜了…",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ce15feaeaa3fae4f04ee9e608f344766e90a7921d2230d46ab6dd6752710db7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "91004"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1143/91004"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:594f2e96b88bd78d5e49a5c4",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "舞蹈课程非常开心。\n大家配合动作时，\n感觉连心也合而为一了…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee9f34b662ff810cfa9aa0fd02f3eecf26a59a33df8812387803bea24c82cb57",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "91005"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1143/91005"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb07d5ba88516e8ea7416c89",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我想用歌声和舞蹈传达。\n愿无论何时，大家都能拥有\n想起笑容的瞬间——",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a0ad9fc8fef5e6d38eb73d84754bcb5362c711b71c1e47039a2231bb6aa949e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "91006"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1143/91006"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7574aec7d9850795a704a943",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我向这身衣装的纯白——起誓。\n我会继续前行，送去洁白闪耀的希望，\n让自己能陪伴每一个人的心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9430eaf49abe2769cd015a10d49d2061b8e521a347924235fa24dc4aadeaea37",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "91007"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1143/91007"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f994e6af24e29a7d930c4761",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这顶帽子，采用了和我小时候戴过的\n那顶一样的设计。\n这样过去的朋友也能立刻认出我——",
      "source_fingerprint": "accba87044512b312c3622cb0d212472f895913b453bcbc32754564b58f2404b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "91008"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1143/91008"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:817c804f6703ed910738941d",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "早上梳理尾巴的时候…我会忍不住\n把尾巴尖打个结，做成一个圆环。\n总会稍微玩一下呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "714754b565a4b3d9924d8e5fbba425de95aaf3ec88cc64af17ff8e97316b9cd7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "91009"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1143/91009"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20d5c68b40ba123aed6aa941",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "统治地位同学的战略…简直像美丽的\n数学公式一样。下一局盘面上，\n会看到怎样的发展呢，我很期待。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f5640e22a4fb89e78b358fecc4f5fab23fd9254e1cc49e4075081f7a0d34304",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "91010"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1143/91010"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7cc79e0ffaa31053f498970e",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我想通过比赛与你连结，\n与你。\n然后——与全世界的人连结。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b0e3bf7755f0c6014a51892d70990dcf0c0727d6898a04713cb0e56d50d530c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "910100"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1143/910100"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34947fb0d7bf4da903396da9",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夜宵要不要来一份鲭鱼三明治？\n虽然简单，却有种让人上瘾的味道，\n从小时候起我就很喜欢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "86e9469ed1db2278cecd6f61121dc8126c7e7f890a9459eb93f46fbea0b5751b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "91011"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1143/91011"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6fe3bc763d7b1fabf7823354",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "赏花会让心变得温暖呢。\n在樱花树下，大家一同欢笑的\n时光…真的非常美好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e28b935d414b5dcc543f306cb87617cd60d5321bd809b0b90b2089be049d4270",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "91012"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1143/91012"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:068d2bdc0b5dfbc89e560372",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "蝉鸣声，很好听呢。\n就像是在有限的时间里竭尽全力，\n歌唱生命的喜悦一样…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b59dd6dafe13c96e3392f682b3fa591a93e169a68eee4032bf5c7999089b6e1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "91013"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1143/91013"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3622ab10b1c31c666de933b2",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "学校活动里常看到的班级T恤\n…很棒呢。穿着同样的心意，\n就像大家的心连在一起一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2af9f3ca752d755b2cdb8a90af169a21bcc112e5bf48364c20bf6744fe09c557",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "91014"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1143/91014"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b2372af6453ea77705eacb9",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "编织真美好呢。\n线与线相互结起，竟然就能做出\n温暖某个人的东西。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aab8ea5912f918f4ee9da08cf821f5726e18f74ceb38c6de6e7d656a89fc615b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "91015"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1143/91015"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f048509da76d1ed759cc8a0",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "多亏有你支持，\n今天我也能专心锻炼了。\n请多关照。",
